Stage 1 The observation model
\[
y_t|\eta_t\sim\text{Bin}(n_t, p_t),\qquad \eta_t = \text{logit}(p_t),\qquad i = 1,\dots,366
\] \[
n_t = \left\{
\begin{array}{lr}
